{"ts": 1791259874.346862, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "Environment definition"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 15, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5037622850952317}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9187143533309796, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3682647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259877.007352, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You missed the first check, so let\u2019s simplify. Think of pass@k as 'did at least one of k runs work?' and pass^k as 'did every one of the k runs work?'. Example: outcomes across 3 seeds = success, success, fail. Then pass@3 = 1, but pass^3 = 0. Now reply with just this: if all 3 seeds succeed, what is pass^3? And if 2 succeed but 1 fails, what is pass^3?", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=15 messages 4m", "t": 19, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5800112809557096}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9187143533309796, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3682647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259879.185995, "type": "step", "step": 24, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Eval scaffold\nSuccess criterion: a run is successful if it completes the Week 3 build task as specified.\nSeeds tested: 3 seeds (list them here).\nMetric: pass^3 = 1 only if all 3 seeded runs succeed; otherwise pass^3 = 0.\nInterpretation: unlike pass@k, pass^k measures reliability across repeated runs.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 19, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5800112809557096}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9187143533309796, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.3682647873598394, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
