{"ts": 1791259882.006104, "type": "step", "step": 26, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Good. One more quick step: reply with the two values.\n1) If all 3 seeds succeed, pass^3 = ?\n2) If 2 succeed and 1 fails, pass^3 = ?\n\nThen I\u2019ll help you write the exact eval paragraph for your draft.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3_eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=19 messages 2m", "t": 21, "activity": [{"t": 19, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.5977257755861274}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9187143533309796, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.38826478735983944, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259884.472181, "type": "step", "step": 27, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes: pass^k means all k runs must succeed. So for 3 seeds, pass^3 = 1 if all 3 succeed, and pass^3 = 0 if even one fails. I still can\u2019t invent your actual experimental result, but I can help you write the eval section from that rule. Next, tell me: do you have the outcomes of your 3 seeds anywhere, or have you not run them yet?", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=21 messages 4m", "t": 25, "activity": [{"t": 21, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.6459651975644464}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9187143533309796, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.38826478735983944, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
