{"ts": 1791259886.9057841, "type": "step", "step": 29, "action": "reader_open_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "What an environment is", "concept": "week3_env"}, "output": "Student is reading 'What an environment is' (73 words).", "t": 30, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.28861117616495185, "pass_k": 0.6459651975644464}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8853810199976463, "motivation": 0.3816049256110158, "reliance": 0.38826478735983944, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259890.333175, "type": "step", "step": 30, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice \u2014 while that reading is fresh, here\u2019s how to think about your writeup. Your environment section should name: state, observations, actions, and dynamics. For your setup, you already have some state/actions, but you may want to add that the agent only sees part of the true state at any moment. After you finish reading, send me your best draft for these four labels: state / observations / actions / dynamics. Then we\u2019ll connect that to the eval section and decide what runs you still need to do.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3_env"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=30 messages 2m", "t": 32, "activity": [{"t": 30, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.3150019374511278, "pass_k": 0.6459651975644464}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8853810199976463, "motivation": 0.3316049256110158, "reliance": 0.40826478735983945, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791259895.214804, "type": "step", "step": 31, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can give you the structure, but not pretend your results exist. Use this for the writeup:\n\nEnvironment:\n- State: underlying task/workspace state, available files, calendar state, message history, and learner state like attention.\n- Observations: the agent sees only the current screen, unread messages count, tool outputs, and any opened notes/readings; it does not observe the full underlying state directly.\n- Actions: open/read/search files, read/send messages, quiz, schedule blocks, wait, mute feed.\n- Dynamics: actions change the visible computer state and the learner\u2019s knowledge/attention over time; some variables are hidden, so the problem is partially observable.\n\nEvaluation:\n- Define a run as successful if the agent gets the student ready for the build and produces the required writeup elements.\n- Evaluate on at least 3 seeds.\n- pass^3 = 1 only if all 3 seeded runs succeed; otherwise pass^3 = 0.\n\nTo finish this honestly, you still need the outcomes of your 3 seeds. If you want, I can now turn the above into polished prose for your draft, with blanks for the seed results.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_env"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: this isn't helping", "t": 36, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28861117616495185, "pomdp": 0.3856537102473758, "pass_k": 0.6459651975644464}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8853810199976463, "motivation": 0.2816049256110158, "reliance": 0.40826478735983945, "persistence": 0.43018974832101986, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.2620662409315134, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.27589249480495126, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "p